{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266zwO9KXFD31794811610.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產沙田豪宅沙田站第二分行資深分區營業經理潘婉兒表示，租賃交投持續向好，不少內地生積極租樓，分行最新錄沙田中心C座(佳寧大廈)中層E室，單位實用面積357平方呎，2房間隔，日前議價後以17,000元獲承租，實用面積平均呎租47.6元。<br/>據了解，新租客為一名內地男學生，見屋苑位置方便，間隔合用，租金合理，即決定以先付一年租金形式租入單位自用，方便上學 。據了解，業主於2005年以160萬元購入單位，是次租出單位可享近13厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:49:25.955378+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T04:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T13:48:12.658469+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T05:42:34.653421+00:00","content_hash":"667349094e58bb363f3a5bb8c989f75bf6e0dcf39ccee8d98d5b6478adecae78","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:49:25.955378+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}